{"id":"e591abf6012c7ea93eb062f4033d13bd3350c630","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1259881","title":"OpenAI 订阅送的 API 额度可以放到 Codex 中用吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"layxy","excerpt":"OpenAI - @layxy - 放 Codex 用是走 ccswitch 还是走 API key 登录？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><div><p><a href=\"/member/layxy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></a></p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a> · <span title=\"2026-11-26 09:29:55 +08:00\">20h 12m ago</span> · 1441 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>放 Codex 用是走 ccswitch 还是走 API key 登录？</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/API\"><li></li> API</a><a href=\"/tag/Codex\"><li></li> Codex</a><a href=\"/tag/额度\"><li></li> 额度</a></P><p><span>9 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-26 16:43:27 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328182\" data-reply-id=\"18328182\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/695f/a135/570212_normal.png?m=1791815104\" alt=\"CakeJu\" data-uid=\"570212\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>1</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我直接走 apikey 登录用的</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328183\" data-reply-id=\"18328183\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/313e5b90068f16fa4071612c0476ba24?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Jlzeng\" data-uid=\"555481\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>2</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>oai 的额度直接接入 codex 会报错，可以用别的 harness</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328214\" data-reply-id=\"18328214\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8f26/ce9f/753233_normal.png?m=1750213620\" alt=\"superluckily\" data-uid=\"753233\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>3</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>可以用的吧，标准的 openai 格式，支持/v1/responses 和  /chat/completions</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328437\" data-reply-id=\"18328437\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/785d/6c97/194443_normal.png?m=1795168498\" alt=\"autumncry\" data-uid=\"194443\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>4</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>可以的啊，赠送的额度就是干这个用的，可以接 claude code ，codex，dsh，都行，但是额度消耗的很快。我的 200 刀交互几轮就用了 100 多了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328575\" data-reply-id=\"18328575\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3da6/bca1/579014_normal.png?m=1655454180\" alt=\"xubeiyou\" data-uid=\"579014\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>5</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我是用 api key 的 200 刀 一天就用完了 一个月的</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18328714\" data-reply-id=\"18328714\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dc2/c645/362284_normal.png?m=1795388490\" alt=\"ty5yidc\" data-uid=\"362284\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>6</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我都是只拿来生成图片用，开发消耗不起</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18329000\" data-reply-id=\"18329000\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bb6af92c90f23296b10c73902e9e1695?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ivee\" data-uid=\"864735\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>不能。官方邮件里有写：</p>\n<p>Unused credits expire at the end of each billing month and can’t be used to power Codex API key usage.</p>\n<p>可以在 Cline/OpenCode/Pi 等支持 openai 接口协议的工具上使用。</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18330476\" data-reply-id=\"18330476\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6fefb9c824b256673835b4fb6c840de7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nicoTingzhen\" data-uid=\"614336\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>9</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>感觉接 codex 意义不大，中途切换供应商/模型，缓存全部丢失。当不了主力，就是在 auth 不方便的地方轻度用用吧</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"layxy · 20h 12m ago · 1441 views 放 Codex 用是走 ccswitch 还是走 API key 登录？ API Codex 额度9 replies • 2026-11-26 16:43:27 +08:00 1 我直接走 apikey 登录用的 2 oai 的额度直接接入 codex 会报错，可以用别的 harness 3 可以用的吧，标准的 openai 格式，支持/v1/responses 和 /chat/completions 4 可以的啊，赠送的额度就是干这个用的，可以接 claude code ，codex，dsh，都行，但是额度消耗的很快。我的 200 刀交互几轮就用了 100 多了 5 我是用 api key 的 200 刀 一天就用完了 一个月的 6 我都是只拿来生成图片用，开发消耗不起 7 不能。官方邮件里有写： Unused credits expire at the end of each 